                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "968b497e-c75d-30de-bb29-9425486d2983",
                        "entry_id": "89cda2c9-3fb7-3e48-9b55-447f4610e93c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "to defecate, to shit"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "colloquial"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8f7ae60e-c724-3777-a0fe-288bad880e30",
                        "entry_id": "89cda2c9-3fb7-3e48-9b55-447f4610e93c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "to soil, to defile"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "colloquial"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fbb9bc3f-5f18-3a45-a088-0b37c26a9c9a",
                        "entry_id": "89cda2c9-3fb7-3e48-9b55-447f4610e93c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "to do mischief, to play dirty tricks on"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2d378f04-b146-4b97-9ca9-829967e665f1",
                                "sense_id": "fbb9bc3f-5f18-3a45-a088-0b37c26a9c9a",
                                "text": "Я, разуме́ется, не суме́ю вам объясни́ть, кому́ и́менно я насолю́ в э́том слу́чае мое́й зло́стью; я отли́чно хорошо́ зна́ю, что и доктора́м я ника́к не смогу́ «нага́дить» тем, что у них не лечу́сь; я лу́чше вся́кого зна́ю, что всем э́тим я еди́нственно то́лько себе́ поврежу́ и никому́ бо́льше.",
                                "translation": "Of course, I can’t explain who it is precisely that I am mortifying in this case by my spite: I am perfectly well aware that I cannot “pay out” the doctors by not consulting them; I know better than anyone that by all this I am only injuring myself and no one else.",
                                "english": "Of course, I can’t explain who it is precisely that I am mortifying in this case by my spite: I am perfectly well aware that I cannot “pay out” the doctors by not consulting them; I know better than anyone that by all this I am only injuring myself and no one else."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
